lug": "echoes-from-ciudadela", "summary": "Echoes from Ciudadela is a first-person adventure and puzzle-solving game focused on exploration, environmental storytelling, and narrative discovery. You play as Katari, who follows the trail of his recently dead father after uncovering his journal, that leads him to a sealed mountain known as Ciudadela.\n\nThroughout the journey, your main artifact is a Balearic sling, a tool tied to both the environment and the forgotten technologies hidden within the mountain. As you dive deeper and solve puzzles, you\u2019ll unlock journal entries left behind by Katari\u2019s father. Each revealing pieces of a lost civilization and their connection to time, invention, and legacy.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/echoes-from-ciudadela", "videos": [{"id": 174693, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "26sZYjzlRn0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=26sZYjzlRn0", "title": "Echoes From Ciudadela | ANNOUNCEMENT TRAILER", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/26sZYjzlRn0/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}